sequenceDiagram
    actor C as Customer
    participant W as Web app
    participant A as API
    participant D as Database
    C->>W: Open "My appointments", click "Cancel"
    W-->>C: "Cancel this appointment?" Yes / Keep it
    C->>W: Yes, cancel
    W->>A: POST cancel
    A->>A: Is it Confirmed and not started yet?
    A->>D: Status = Cancelled, delete its slot rows (one transaction)
    A-->>W: 200 OK, status Cancelled
    W-->>C: Shows "Cancelled"
    Note over A,D: The technician, bay and car are free again at once
